WEBVTT

00:44:29.556 --> 00:44:32.036
you had the entire Soviet bloc around it.

00:44:33.076 --> 00:44:37.716
So it's easier in this sense
to isolate it.

00:44:38.116 --> 00:44:39.836
It's much more vulnerable.

00:44:40.596 --> 00:44:44.036
Again, does it mean that sanctions
would work like a miracle

00:44:44.036 --> 00:44:45.756
and stop the tanks? No.

00:44:45.796 --> 00:44:47.516
It takes time.

00:44:48.596 --> 00:44:55.316
But I think that the West is in a position

00:44:55.356 --> 00:44:58.236
to impact Russia

00:44:58.276 --> 00:45:02.116
with these kinds of sanctions
and isolation much more